{"type":"agent_end","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"设计一个 5 升 6 的暑期过渡方案，共 6 次课。请回表选出：5 年级里必须夯实、否则会拖累 6 年级的课标（给编号和它拖累的 6 年级编号），以及 6 年级开学前值得先铺垫的课标。按 6 次课排布，每次课注明「巩固」还是「铺垫」及对应编号。"}],"timestamp":1788754173491},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking in Chinese. They want a summer transition plan for going from Grade 5 to Grade 6 (5升6 means \"rising from grade 5 to grade 6\"), with 6 lessons total. They want:\n\n1. A table of Grade 5 standards that must be solidified, otherwise they will drag down Grade 6 standards (give the standard codes and which Grade 6 codes they drag down)\n2. Grade 6 standards worth previewing/laying groundwork for before school starts\n3. Arrange into 6 lessons, each marked as \"巩固\" (consolidate) or \"铺垫\" (groundwork/preview) with corresponding standard codes\n\nThey mention \"请回表\" which likely means \"请列表\" (please list in a table). I should use the math-standards skill to look up the actual Common Core standards for Grade 5 and Grade 6.\n\nLet me first read the skill file to understand how to query the standards.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_3958c9a0f8954af099911114","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/Users/l/other_git_repos/calculus-quest/nodejs_react_lib/learn-claude-code/custom_skill_space/math-standards/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"ark-plan","model":"glm-5.3","usage":{"input":145,"output":244,"cacheRead":2176,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":2565,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0},"cacheWrite1h":0},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788754173507,"responseId":"0217887541737057d6713dc852f73f0cf900d2fbe3d4488253bc3","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_3958c9a0f8954af099911114","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: math-standards\ndescription: 查询美国 Common Core 数学课程标准（K-8 与高中五个概念类别，共 385 条）。按课标编号（如 K.CC.4、8.G.7、S-MD.5）、年级或领域查出课标要求原文、所属领域/知识点与 PDF 页码。需要核对某条课标怎么说、某年级某领域包含哪些要求、或把教学内容对齐到课标编号时使用。\n---\n\n# Common Core 数学课标查询\n\n数据来自 `数学课标整理表格.xlsx`，已整理成两个文件：\n\n- `references/index.md` —— 年级 × 领域的总览表（条数、编号示例）。先看它定位范围。\n- `references/standards.csv` —— 全量 385 条，列为\n  `code, grade, domain, cluster, requirement, pdf_page`。\n\n年级取值：K, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, High School — Number and Quantity, High School — Algebra, High School — Functions, High School — Geometry, High School — Statistics and Probability。\n\n## 怎么查\n\n编号已知时直接按编号取行（编号在第一列，行首匹配最准）：\n\n```bash\ngrep -m1 '^8.G.7,' references/standards.csv\n```\n\n按年级或领域筛选，只看编号和要求两列：\n\n```bash\nawk -F',' '$2==\"5\"' references/standards.csv | cut -d',' -f1,5\ngrep ',Geometry,' references/standards.csv | cut -d',' -f1,5\n```\n\n按关键词找（例如勾股定理相关）：\n\n```bash\ngrep -i 'pythagorean' references/standards.csv | cut -d',' -f1,2,5\n```\n\n`requirement` 字段里含逗号，所以取整行文本时用 `grep` 原样输出，别用 `cut` 切到第 5 列以后。\n\n## 回答约定\n\n- 引用课标要求时给出**原文**（英文）加编号，必要时再翻译。\n- 一并给出 `grade` / `domain` 和 `pdf_page`，方便回到 PDF 核对。\n- 表里没有的条目直说没有，不要照编号规律臆造。\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1788754178676},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me look at the standards for Grade 5 and Grade 6 to design this plan. First, let me get an overview from the index, then look at the actual standards.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_76259db28ffc47dc9fa370e0","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /Users/l/other_git_repos/calculus-quest/nodejs_react_lib/learn-claude-code/custom_skill_space/math-standards && cat references/index.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_4b054d0d784d4f9abc1f768c","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /Users/l/other_git_repos/calculus-quest/nodejs_react_lib/learn-claude-code/custom_skill_space/math-standards && awk -F',' '$2==\"5\"' references/standards.csv | cut -d',' -f1"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"ark-plan","model":"glm-5.3","usage":{"input":781,"output":145,"cacheRead":2304,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":3230,"cost":{"input":